        "en": "It is located on Avenida Homero 1416, in the Polanco II Sección neighborhood, Miguel Hidalgo borough in Mexico City."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿Disponen de servicios médicos especializados y cirugía?",
        "en": "Do they provide specialized veterinary medicine and surgery?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Sí, cuentan con diversas especialidades médicas, cirugía avanzada, hospitalización y apoyo diagnóstico para perros y gatos.",
        "en": "Yes, they provide various veterinary specialties, advanced surgery, hospitalization, and diagnostic support for dogs and cats."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
